  "doc.title": "Why One Interest Rate Moves the Price of Everything · An Interactive Essay",
  "doc.desc": "Starting from what tomorrow's money is worth today, step through bonds, the yield curve, central bank reserves, the Taylor rule, the New Keynesian model, stocks, houses, exchange rates, quantitative easing and government debt, ending with where the major central banks stand in late 2026 and the open debates. Thirteen models you can push.",
  "nav.back": "← Knowledge index",
  "nav.lang": "Language",
